{"publicId":"13190dd3-2786-4ef6-b338-655cf4e22dfc","title":"美国钢铁关税调整引发行业竞争格局变化","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T12:11:00.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-17T12:11:00.000Z","digest":"分析指出，美国钢铁关税调整正快速改变行业竞争格局，导致不同企业股价表现分化，Nucor年内涨幅领先，Fortescue跌幅最大。\n\n该调整通过影响进口成本和生产地选择，改变了钢铁企业的竞争条件。数据显示，依赖北美本土供应链的Nucor受益于关税保护，而依赖澳洲出口的Fortescue因关税导致需求转移而承压。研究同时指出，基建支出预期和供需关系变化对股价有叠加影响，关税效应与市场周期需结合评估。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T12:27:06.468Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"钢铁股走势背后的因素","latestReport":{"id":"w0iemwpw0ulb6xlu31co70n1u"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fPX1FoL8jrZ0","title":"Steel tariffs can change competitive conditions quickly","firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T12:11:00.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"w0iemwpw0ulb6xlu31co70n1u","title":"钢铁股走势背后的因素","summary":"summary_z: 钢铁股的表现受关税影响各异，取决于生产地和客户渠道。需求变化也影响股价，基础设施支出可提振订单，而供过于求则会压低利润。今年前10个月，Nucor表现最佳，而Fortescue表现最差。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T12:11:00.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"w0iemwpw0ulb6xlu31co70n1u","title":"钢铁股走势背后的因素","summary":"summary_z: 钢铁股的表现受关税影响各异，取决于生产地和客户渠道。需求变化也影响股价，基础设施支出可提振订单，而供过于求则会压低利润。今年前10个月，Nucor表现最佳，而Fortescue表现最差。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T12:11:00.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T13:00:00.000Z","heat":9.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T14:00:00.000Z","heat":9.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","heat":9.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T16:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T17:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T19:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T20:00:00.000Z","heat":8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026